  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buxeros Capital I B.V.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Emerging Americas and Asia Investment Fund is a new fund that will invest in joint ventures between a Dutch SME and a local SME in one of the DGGF focus countries of the fund. For Asia the focus will be on: Vietnam, Thailand , Philippines, Pakistan , India and Indonesia , and for Latin America the focus will be on: Guatemala , Nicaragua, Colombia , Peru and Suriname. The fund is expected to invest in at least 10 Joint Ventures. These JV&#x2019;s will create jobs, knowledge transfer and increase local production in the abovementioned DGGF countries. This will be reported and monitored on an annual basis.</narrative>
  </description>
